## Usage

### Automatic Delay Detection
```bash
# Automatically detect delay between two microphones
./virtual-mic-delay --detect-delay
```

This will:
1. Ask you to select camera microphone
2. Ask you to select computer microphone
3. Play test tone through virtual device
4. Record from both mics simultaneously
5. Calculate delay using cross-correlation
6. Suggest and apply delay value

