## Troubleshooting

### No audio devices found
- Ensure virtual audio driver is installed (BlackHole/PulseAudio)
- Check audio permissions: `System Preferences > Security > Microphone`
- Restart audio server: Linux: `pulseaudio -k && pulseaudio --start`

### Delay detection fails
- Ensure both microphones can hear the test tone
- Check that output device (virtual) is connected to both inputs
- Try in a quiet environment to reduce noise

### Poor audio quality
- Increase buffer size: `--buffer 2048`
- Reduce CPU usage by closing other audio apps
- Use higher sample rate: `--rate 48000`

